sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Student Browser
    participant LF as LMS Frontend
    participant LB as LMS Backend
    participant DB as SQLite DB

    S->>LF: Opens StudentDashboard
    LF->>LB: GET /students/me/progress
    LB->>DB: Enrolled courses + getCourseProgress() per course
    DB-->>LB: completedLessonItems, totalLessonItems, lessonPercentage
    LB-->>LF: [{courseId, courseName, lessonsCompleted, totalLessons, lessonPercentage, certStatus}]
    LF-->>S: Course cards with progress bars (N/M lessons, %)

    S->>LF: Opens StudentCourse
    LF->>LB: GET /courses/:id/progress
    LB->>DB: getCourseProgress(userId, courseId)
    DB-->>LB: {completedLessonItems, totalLessonItems, lessonPercentage}
    LB-->>LF: progress data
    LF-->>S: Sticky top progress bar

    S->>LF: Checks off a lesson
    LF->>LB: POST /courses/:courseId/lessons/completions\nbody:{itemId}
    LB->>DB: INSERT OR IGNORE lesson_completions
    DB-->>LB: ok
    LF->>LB: GET /courses/:id/progress (refresh)
    LB-->>LF: updated progress
    LF-->>S: Progress bar advances in real time
